      {
        "id": "a001",
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "**Firmware (Position Control Mode).** duty = PGain (goal - encoder), PGain = kp_fw 4096/(2 pi)/(256 885) [BAM]; clamped to the current-limit window (kt w +- R i_limit)/V_bus (BAM's limiter) and to +-100 % PWM. The goal arrives t_latency late.",
        "x": 0,
        "y": -170,
        "w": 900,
        "h": 110,
        "color": "blue"
      },
      {
        "id": "a002",
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "**Motor and gear (BAM XL330 M6 fit, output side).** H-bridge MTF (duty) -> winding R -> GY kt/N -> rotor I (armature/N^2) -> gear TF 1/N (N = 288.4) -> BAM M6 friction (load dependent, Stribeck) -> 2 deg backlash (smooth, no solver events) -> horn. The encoder reads the horn (after the play).",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 780,
        "w": 1100,
        "h": 110,
        "color": "blue"
      }
    ]
